We can see that Uniswap [NonfungiblePositionManager.sol](https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-periphery/blob/697c2474757ea89fec12a4e6db16a574fe259610/contracts/NonfungiblePositionManager.sol#L156) uses `_mint` when opening a position for a user, instead of `_safeMint` (o.e receiver may be a contract, which is not `IERC721Receiver`). 
